---
source: src/release.rs
expression: note_prompt(&titles)
---
You write the release note of a software project from the titles of the issues it closes. Group them under a few `### ` headings that fit what they do, such as Added, Changed, Fixed or Removed. Keep every title's words exactly as written, list every title once, and invent nothing: the titles below are all there is, so read no file. Answer with nothing but the sections, each a `### Heading` line then its `- Title` lines, with no introduction or closing.

---
- Add a flag
- Fix the box
